      "text": "[6:34AM]  #LagBadagryExp\n#TrafficUpdate\nVehicular movement around Badagry roundabout is good presently.  Movement from Badagry roundabout through Ibereko axis, Aradagun, Mowo, Oko Afo enroute Ibiye down to Ajibade is equally good.\n\n Ajibade through Morogbo junction down to Agbara Custom Check Point moves slowly  due to high influx moving inward Ijanikin coupled with the massive pedestrian crossing around the corridor.  \n\nThe return journey from Agbara Custom Check Point through Agbara Estate gate down to Ajibade is good.\n#FollowLASTMA\n@TrafficChiefNG \n@lagostraffic961",
